.TH AVR\-VM\-STOP 1 "" "avr 0.3.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-vm-stop \- Stop a running VM.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr vm stop
[OPTIONS] VM_ID
.SH DESCRIPTION
Stop a running VM.
.PP
Stop a running VM. The ephemeral disk is discarded.
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fIVM_ID\fR
\&
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-wait\fR
Wait until the VM reaches STOPPED before returning.
.TP
\fB\-\-wait\-timeout\fR \fIINTEGER\fR
Seconds to wait when --wait is set. (default: 300)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit the raw API response as JSON.
